<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41433" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rē-strŭo</span></b> , xi, ctum,
		3, v. a., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to erect again</i> (eccl. Lat.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aras,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tert. Apol. 6 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">statuas dejectas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ad Nat. 1, 10</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>to restore</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Deus eam restruebat fidem, quam populus
					destruebat,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tert. Res. Carn. 31</span></i>
			.</div>
